ed_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:02.377887+00:00\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"action_buttons\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"🔄 Overwrite existing\",\n      \"action\": \"overwrite\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"➕ Keep both\",\n      \"action\": \"coexist\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"chain_of_thought\": {\n    \"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },","\"content\": \"I found **111 existing ITR automations** in your account:\\n\\n  • [ITR] customer team usa ITR - Intro Menu\\n  • [ITR] customer team usa ITR Menu - Requesting Promo Consent\\n  • [ITR] customer team usa ITR Menu - Department Options\\n  • [ITR] customer team usa ITR Menu - Transfer to 🤖 Set up Interactive Text Receptionist\\n  • [ITR] customer team usa ITR - Step 2 Add, Step 1 Remove\\n  • [ITR] customer team usa ITR - Step 3 Added, Remove Step 2\\n  • [ITR] marketing india ITR - Intro","Step 2\\n  • [ITR] marketing india ITR - Intro Menu\\n  • [ITR] marketing india ITR Menu - Requesting Promo Consent\\n  • [ITR] marketing india ITR Menu - Department Options\\n  • [ITR] marketing india ITR Menu - Transfer to Sampleeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee\\n  • ... and 101 more\\n\\nWould you like to:\\n1. **Overwrite** — Replace the existing ITR setup with a new one\\n2. **Keep both** — Create a new ITR setup alongside the existing one\",","\"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:02.378763+00:00\",\n  \"message_boxes\": [],\n  \"role\": \"assistant\",\n  \"tools_used\": []\n},\n{\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"content\": \"🔄 Overwrite existing\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:21.294991+00:00\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"action_buttons\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"🌐 Website & Business Info ✅\",\n      \"action\": \"enter website_seeding\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"👥 Account Setup\",\n      \"action\": \"enter account_setup\",","\"action\": \"enter account_setup\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"📋 Consent & Compliance\",\n      \"action\": \"enter consent_capture\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"📞 Text routing\",\n      \"action\": \"enter routing\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"✅ Review & Build\",\n      \"action\": \"enter review_educate\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"chain_of_thought\": {","\"button_context\": {},\n  \"chain_of_thought\": {\n    \"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },","\"content\": \"Here’s your ITR setup hub. Pick a section to continue:\\n\\n1. 🌐 **Website & Business Info** — ✅ Complete\\n2. 👥 **Account Setup** — ⬜ Not started\\n   _Verify your phone numbers, users, and department mappings._\\n3. 📋 **Consent & Compliance** — ⬜ Not started\\n   _Set up consent types, language, and compliance settings._\\n4. 📞 **Text routing** — ⬜ Not started\\n   _Configure how incoming calls are routed across departments._\\n5. ✅ **Review & Build** — ⬜ Not started\\n   _Review your","& Build** — ⬜ Not started\\n   _Review your setup, learn how it works, and build your automations._\\n\\n> **Note:** Existing ITR automations will be replaced when you build.\",","\"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:21.295836+00:00\",\n  \"message_boxes\": [],\n  \"role\": \"assistant\",\n  \"tools_used\": [],\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:22.505693+00:00\"\n},\n{\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"content\": \"📞 Text routing\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:28.750296+00:00\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"content\": \"📞 Text routing\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:28.751858+00:00\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"action_buttons\": [\n    {","\"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"action_buttons\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"site_6a0c23e89f69ee68fcb4f4cf\",\n      \"label\": \"Main Site\",\n      \"action\": \"SELECT_SITE\",\n      \"site_id\": \"6a0c23e89f69ee68fcb4f4cf\",\n      \"site_name\": \"Main Site\",\n      \"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"site_6a13e228416dac01f39da6bc\",\n      \"label\": \"2nd\",\n      \"action\": \"SELECT_SITE\",\n      \"site_id\": \"6a13e228416dac01f39da6bc\",\n      \"site_name\": \"2nd\",\n      \"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {","\"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"site_6a34c7d93d130c46b171d2fd\",\n      \"label\": \"test\",\n      \"action\": \"SELECT_SITE\",\n      \"site_id\": \"6a34c7d93d130c46b171d2fd\",\n      \"site_name\": \"test\",\n      \"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"site_6a34c8bd3d130c46b171d30f\",\n      \"label\": \"sdfghj\",\n      \"action\": \"SELECT_SITE\",\n      \"site_id\": \"6a34c8bd3d130c46b171d30f\",\n      \"site_name\": \"sdfghj\",\n      \"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {","\"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"⬅️ Back to Hub\",\n      \"action\": \"back to hub\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"chain_of_thought\": {\n    \"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },","\"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },\n  \"content\": \"Your Beetexting account has **4** sites.  \\nChoose **one or more** sites to pull departments from for ITR.\\n\\n1. Main Site\\n2. 2nd\\n3. test\\n4. sdfghj\\n\\n👉 Toggle the site buttons below if you want multiple selections.\\n- Your picks will show in the input as a comma-separated list — then press **Send**.\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:30.007486+00:00\",\n  \"message_boxes\": [],\n  \"role\": \"assistant\",\n  \"tools_used\": [],","\"role\": \"assistant\",\n  \"tools_used\": [],\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:31.111786+00:00\"\n},\n{\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"content\": \"test\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:34.115797+00:00\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"action_buttons\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"dept_6a573335891e4136458ffe8f\",\n      \"label\": \"OOO\",\n      \"action\": \"SELECT_DEPARTMENT\",\n      \"department_id\": \"6a573335891e4136458ffe8f\",\n      \"department_name\": \"OOO\",\n      \"department_number\": \"+14486244545\",","\"department_number\": \"+14486244545\",\n      \"type\": \"message_box\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"⬅️ Back to Hub\",\n      \"action\": \"back to hub\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"chain_of_thought\": {\n    \"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },","\"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },\n  \"content\": \"🔧 Now let’s set up your main line — this is the number that will receive new customer messages.\\n\\nHere are your available departments:\\n\\n1. OOO - (448) 624-4545\\n\\n👉 Please select **one or more** departments to set up ITR for.\\n- Click the department buttons to select multiple.\\n- Your selection will appear in the input as a comma-separated list — then press **Send**.\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:34.352169+00:00\",","\"message_boxes\": [],\n  \"role\": \"assistant\",\n  \"tools_used\": [],\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:35.375200+00:00\"\n},\n{\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"content\": \"OOO\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:38.700144+00:00\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n},\n{\n  \"action_buttons\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"🚀 Build Automations\",\n      \"action\": \"create\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"✏️ Edit\",\n      \"action\": \"EDIT\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {","\"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"⬅️ Back to Hub\",\n      \"action\": \"back to hub\",\n      \"type\": \"direct_message\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"button_context\": {},\n  \"chain_of_thought\": {\n    \"tool_steps\": [],\n    \"thinking\": []\n  },","\"content\": \"Your ITR is ready to build — take a quick look, then click **🚀 Build Automations** to create it. Nothing will go live until you confirm.\\n\\n**What you've set up**\\n- 🌐 **Business info** from beetexting.com\\n- 📞 **Main line:** *OOO* greets every new message\\n- 🛡️ **Consent:** none — contacts go straight to the menu (you can add a consent step anytime)\\n\\n**What I'll build** — 4 automations + 3 tags\\n- A welcome message that greets new contacts and shows the menu\\n- A department","new contacts and shows the menu\\n- A department menu so contacts pick who they need\\n- Behind-the-scenes tag automations that track each contact's step (kept tidy automatically)\\n\\nDoes this look right? Click **🚀 Build Automations** — or **✏️ Edit** if you want to change anything.\",","\"created_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:40.710362+00:00\",\n  \"message_boxes\": [],\n  \"role\": \"assistant\",\n  \"tools_used\": [],\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-26T05:45:42.164761+00:00\"\n}]"],"uris":null}␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀